WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,050 --> 00:00:05,650
You are older than others

2
00:00:05,850 --> 00:00:07,090
One song at a time

3
00:00:07,650 --> 00:00:09,810
You think this brother is quite smooth-talking

4
00:00:10,210 --> 00:00:15,560
I heard the big boss is coming today

5
00:00:15,960 --> 00:00:21,610
It's so dangerous for him to be here at this time.

6
00:00:21,770 --> 00:00:22,930
The big boss is so rich

7
00:00:22,930 --> 00:00:24,050
Why aren't you running?

8
00:00:25,980 --> 00:00:28,100
I heard that the big boss is the daughter of a mistress

9
00:00:28,380 --> 00:00:30,790
I am not pampered at home but this company

10
00:00:30,790 --> 00:00:31,990
He invested it himself

11
00:00:31,990 --> 00:00:32,990
Particularly attentive

12
00:00:33,510 --> 00:00:35,190
So the project was suddenly suspended

13
00:00:35,390 --> 00:00:36,390
Quite unexpected

14
00:00:36,910 --> 00:00:44,870
That Miao knife is so beautiful

15
00:00:45,350 --> 00:00:46,350
I always feel

16
00:00:46,510 --> 00:00:48,310
The value is higher than what the team leader said

17
00:00:48,590 --> 00:00:49,830
Definitely not worth tens of thousands

18
00:00:50,690 --> 00:00:51,810
But such an expensive knife

19
00:00:52,010 --> 00:00:54,090
How could it be placed in a pile of broken props?
